<h3>Preparation</h3>

<ul>
	<li><p>Carefully inscribe "DJT" onto the Cheeto with the pin. (If instead you went with the candle or carrot, inscribe it with
		the target's full name.)</p></li>
	<li><p>Lean the Tower card on something (the candle, perhaps), face forward, upright.</p></li>
	<li><p>Arrange the other items in a pleasing circle in front of you.</p></li>
	<li><p>Say a prayer of protection to your preferred spirit or deity. (Christians, as well as many magical traditions, use
		the 23rd Psalm.</p></li>
</ul>

